{"publicId":"5750d92f-ba44-408b-8912-bd56c43ef57f","title":"外汇汇率惯例对指数表现的影响分析","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T14:30:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T14:30:00.000Z","digest":"Seeking Alpha于2026-11-11发布研究报告，明确外汇汇率被多数投资者忽视但直接影响指数表现评估。该研究指出，外汇汇率波动会改变指数回报的测得数值（如美元计价指数）、基准跟踪误差（尤其涉及跨国资产配置的指数），并影响主动管理者的绩效评估结果。核心结论是：未纳入外汇波动的指数计算可能失真，需在基准跟踪和业绩评估中单独计量汇率风险敞口。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T17:37:42.811Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"外汇惯例如何影响指数表现","latestReport":{"id":"hu664o662ste4g1zyliwqqaz3"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fkpBOwzKULnc","title":"如何影响指数表现的外汇惯例","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T14:30:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"hu664o662ste4g1zyliwqqaz3","title":"外汇惯例如何影响指数表现","summary":"投资者往往忽视用于计算指数回报的外汇汇率，但这些汇率会影响测得的表现、基准跟踪，甚至对主动管理者的评估。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T14:30:00.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"hu664o662ste4g1zyliwqqaz3","title":"外汇惯例如何影响指数表现","summary":"投资者往往忽视用于计算指数回报的外汇汇率，但这些汇率会影响测得的表现、基准跟踪，甚至对主动管理者的评估。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T14:30:00.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T20:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T21:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1}],"related":[],"topics":[{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}]}